
@startuml
title SysMon - User Creation Activity Diagram

|Admin (Tier 1)|
start
:Open Users panel;
:Select Add User;

|SysMon Frontend|
:Display user creation form;

|Admin (Tier 1)|
:Enter username, password and tier;
:Commit changes;

|SysMon Authentication System|
:Validate supplied user data;

while (User data invalid?) is (Yes)
  |SysMon Frontend|
  :Display validation error;
  |Admin (Tier 1)|
  :Correct username, password or tier;
  :Commit changes;
  |SysMon Authentication System|
  :Validate supplied user data;
endwhile (No)

:Create new user account;
:Assign selected admin tier;
:Initialize account with no permissions;

|SysMon Frontend|
:Display creation success;

|Admin (Tier 1)|
:View newly created account;
stop
@enduml
